<doc id="21432" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21432" title="Kali Jordan">
Kali Jordan

Kali Jordan (&lt;a href="Hebrew%20language"&gt;Hebrew&lt;/a&gt;: נהר הירדן nehar hayarden, &lt;a href="Arabic%20language"&gt;Arabic&lt;/a&gt;: نهر الأردن nahr al-urdun) iku &lt;a href="kali"&gt;kali&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Asia%20Kidul-kulon"&gt;Asia Kidul-kulon&lt;/a&gt; mili ngliwati &lt;a href="Lembah%20Great%20Rift"&gt;Lembah Great Rift&lt;/a&gt; tumuju menyang &lt;a href="Sagara%20Mati"&gt;Sagara Mati&lt;/a&gt;. Miturut sajarah lan agama, kali iki minangka kali kang paling dianggep suci ing donya.
Kali iki dawané 251 &lt;a href="kilom%C3%A8ter"&gt;kilomèter&lt;/a&gt; (156 &lt;a href="mil"&gt;mil&lt;/a&gt;). Anak utawa cawang kaliné (&lt;a href="tributary"&gt;tributary&lt;/a&gt;) ya iku: 
<ol>
<li>&lt;a href="Kali%20Hasbani"&gt;Hasbani&lt;/a&gt; (Hebrew: שניר senir, Arabic: الحاصباني hasbani), kang mili saka &lt;a href="Libanon"&gt;Libanon&lt;/a&gt;.</<li>
<li>&lt;a href="Kali%20Banias"&gt;Banias&lt;/a&gt; (Hebrew: חרמון hermon, Arabic: بانياس banias), saka sumber (&lt;a href="spring%20%28hydrosphere%29"&gt;spring&lt;/a&gt;) ing &lt;a href="Banias"&gt;Banias&lt;/a&gt; ing sikilé &lt;a href="Gunung%20Hermon"&gt;Gunung Hermon&lt;/a&gt;.</<li>
<li>&lt;a href="Kali%20Dan%20%28Jordan%29"&gt;Dan&lt;/a&gt; (Hebrew: דן dan, Arabic: اللدان leddan), sumberé uga saka Gunung Hermon.</<li>
<li>Kali Iyon (Hebrew: עיון iyon, Arabic: دردره derdara or براغيث braghith), kang mili saka Libanon.</<li>
</ol>
Kapapat kali mau nggabung dadi Kali &lt;a href="Jordan"&gt;Jordan&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israèl&lt;/a&gt; sisih lor, cedhak &lt;a href="kibbutz"&gt;kibbutz&lt;/a&gt; Sede Nehemya. Kali iki mili mudhun kanthi rikat sajeroning 75 kilomèter tumuju menyang tlatah rawa &lt;a href="Lake%20Hula"&gt;Lake Hula&lt;/a&gt;, kang dumunung sethithik sangisoré luahing sagara ing &lt;a href="Sagara%20Galilee"&gt;Sagara Galilee&lt;/a&gt;. Metu saka tlaga, iliné mudhun manèh watara 25 kilomèter tumuju menyang &lt;a href="Sagara%20Galilee"&gt;Sagara Galilee&lt;/a&gt;. Pérangan pungkasan luwih rata, lan kali wiwit mili ménggak-mènggok sadurungé lumebu menyang &lt;a href="Sagara%20Mati"&gt;Sagara Mati&lt;/a&gt;, kang dumunung watara 400 mèter sangisoré lumahing sagara lan minangka sagara buntu. Loro cawang kali utama mili saka wétan ing pérangan pungkasan ya iku: &lt;a href="Kali%20Yarmouk"&gt;Kali Yarmouk&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kali%20Jabbok"&gt;Jabbok&lt;/a&gt;.
