<doc id="21607" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21607" title="Kali Bandama">
Kali Bandama

Kali Bandama iku kali kang paling dawa ing nagara &lt;a href="Pasisir%20Gadhing"&gt;Pasisir Gadhing&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="C%C3%B4te%20d%27Ivoire"&gt;Côte d'Ivoire&lt;/a&gt;, dawané udakara 800 kilomèter. Kali kang mili mangidul iki éntuk banyu saka kali &lt;a href="Kali%20Marahou%C3%A9"&gt;Marahoué&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kali%20Solomougou"&gt;Solomougou&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kali%20Kan%20River"&gt;Kan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kali%20Nzi%20River"&gt;Nzi&lt;/a&gt; lan muarané ana ing &lt;a href="Tagba%20Lagoon"&gt;Tagba Lagoon&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Lempongan%20Guinea"&gt;Lempongan Guinea&lt;/a&gt;.
Kali Bandama mili ngliwati &lt;a href="Tlaga%20Kossou"&gt;Tlaga Kossou&lt;/a&gt;, sawijining tlaga gawéan kang diyasa taun 1973 nalika yasa &lt;a href="Dam%20Kossou"&gt;Dam Kossou&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Kossou"&gt;Kossou&lt;/a&gt;.
Yamousssoukro, kutha krajan &lt;a href="C%C3%B4te%20d%27Ivoire"&gt;Côte d'Ivoire&lt;/a&gt;, dumunung ana ing pinggiré Kali Bandama.
