Sawijining lindhu kanthi kakuwatan 5.2 SR kadadéan tanggal &lt;a href="21%20November"&gt;21 November&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;. lan 4.9 SR tanggal &lt;a href="1%20Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;1 Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;.
